---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'August 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="PromptDNS privacy policy: browser-side lookups, no query logging, minimal analytics."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    <div class="rich-text mt-8">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        DNS lookups you run on PromptDNS happen <strong>in your browser</strong>, directly
        against public DNS-over-HTTPS resolvers (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9). The domains you
        check are <strong>not sent to our servers, not stored, and not logged by us</strong>.
      </p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Anonymous, aggregate usage analytics</strong> (page views, referrers, country) via privacy-friendly, cookieless measurement. It cannot identify you.</li>
        <li><strong>Account data (if you create one):</strong> email address and the domains you monitor, when you subscribe to monitoring. Processed solely to provide the service.</li>
        <li><strong>Payments</strong> are processed by our payment provider; we never see or store card numbers.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we deliberately do not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No logging of the domains or records you look up.</li>
        <li>No advertising trackers or cross-site cookies.</li>
        <li>No selling or sharing of personal data. Ever.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        Your browser talks directly to public DoH resolvers to perform lookups; those providers
        process your queries under their own privacy policies. We use a payment provider for
        subscriptions and a privacy-friendly analytics service. No other third parties receive
        your data.
      </p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access, correction, export, or deletion of your account data at any
        time via <code>privacy@promptdns.com</code>. Deleting your account deletes your monitored
        domains and report history.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes materially, we will announce it on this page with a new update
        date. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: <code>privacy@promptdns.com</code></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Legal cross-link -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/40 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Related terms</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
        Looking for our commercial terms and acceptable use policy? Read our
        <a href="/terms/" class="font-medium text-accent hover:text-accent-soft underline underline-offset-2">Terms of Service</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
